From: Iltix <dev@iltix.de>
Date: Sat, 19 Apr 2026 00:00:01 +0000
Subject: Iltix Module Settings Infrastructure

Adds the "Iltix Module" settings screen where all Iltix features can be
toggled on or off independently. All features are enabled by default.

The infrastructure consists of:
- IltixModuleManager: singleton managing feature flag state via SharedPreferences
- IltixModuleSettingsFragment: Settings fragment shown under "Iltix Module"
- A hook into main_preferences.xml to surface the new settings entry
- Iltix-specific string resources in a separate .grdp file

This patch intentionally leaves upstream strings untouched. All Iltix UI
strings live in:
  chrome/browser/ui/android/strings/iltix_android_chrome_strings_grd/

